{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0062_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_05_synopsis", "source_sha256": "f6a8fd723ef2b0177bb3a3a243f1b036c4d8c7951e58e346743c6690535f3e49", "ja": "自分はジュリアにふさわしくないのでは、と\n悩む静香。しかし未来達の言葉で本当の\n気持ちに気付かされる。ジュリアに合わせる\nのではなく、並び立つために。\n決意を新たに、静香は再び立ち上がる。", "zh": "静香认为自己配不上茱莉亚而烦恼。\n但是听了未来她们一番话，\n令她察觉自己真正的想法。\n她不需要配合茱莉亚，而是该与她并驾齐驱。\n于是静香重新下定决心，再次振作。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0062_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_05_1000_p", "source_sha256": "da903b4ea1c9894ab2fc2f9f0b7634fb731153a0aeaa200e64e5b37f2b977613", "ja": "（なんとかジュリア達を、時間通りに送り届けられた。\nさて、早く……うん？）", "zh": "（总算是赶上时间送茱莉亚她们过去了。\n好了，赶快……嗯？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0062_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_05_1001_015siz", "source_sha256": "5351b6ec3b56b1df0f2b07bf157bc071edb7aebf8f7e96d499487f10fcbb8372", "ja": "あっ。……{$P$}。", "zh": "啊……{$P$}。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0062_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_05_1002_p", "source_sha256": "8b0dc68a426945e1dc9e504028cc9950a4742c24b8536ae2a9d0f238bd47b586", "ja": "静香……来てたのか。\nもしかして、俺を待っててくれたのか？", "zh": "静香……原来你有来。\n该不会一直在等我吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0062_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_05_1003_015siz", "source_sha256": "f347d3d4a20bdd0b50c832fbcd2d7acd209b7661e3e03c8a308fd5c57f90526b", "ja": "ええ、まあ。\nその……昨日は、すみませんでした。", "zh": "嗯，是啊。\n那个……昨天的事，真的很抱歉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0062_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_05_1004_p", "source_sha256": "e9c2163bd6cfdb850c69da0e0b06a041ba41911a5193f5d8b00b73e1efb90063", "ja": "いや、こっちこそ不本意な決断をさせて悪かった。\nそれで……どうだ？　明日、いけそうか？", "zh": "不会，我才该道歉，不该让你做出不情愿的抉择。\n那么……怎么样？明天没问题吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0062_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_05_1005_015siz", "source_sha256": "14a4c0535678c0259a42daa7aca76ab6bdce3667c15ccffc077f42184e7fb97c", "ja": "……わかりません。まだ。あれからずっと考えて\nいたんですけど……やっぱり、自信が……ありません。", "zh": "……我不知道。\n之后我就一直在思考……但我还是……没有自信。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0062_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_05_1006_015siz", "source_sha256": "37b5a2277ccd063c92cbafc6880533a3332a9f8f90b071b03ea64d2c4b7a6b1d", "ja": "でもひとつだけ、わかったことがあります。\nそれは……。あの……。", "zh": "不过至少，我想通了一件事情。\n那就是……我……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0062_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_05_1007_015siz", "source_sha256": "642a088bc729974c759daaced5b6b35c4f4d95425e710c5faa1f9eaa546cc434", "ja": "今の私は……。ジュリアさんの足を\n引っ張っているだけってことです……。", "zh": "现在的我……\n只会扯茱莉亚的后腿而已……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0062_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_05_1008_p", "source_sha256": "03564cf30f63333cf89c26ad8717bb6751cbdf8b14e34dc3805c05549a48e8d4", "ja": "ちょっと待て、それは違う。\nふたりはただ、共通のイメージが……。", "zh": "等一下，不是这样的。\n你们只是还没找到共识……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0062_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_05_1009_015siz", "source_sha256": "d6141f48aa92d09433fca6936f7f54546ddebaf9e3dd5b81dce275c3fe231fa5", "ja": "わかってます。でも、私に合わせることで、\nジュリアさんの良さが出せなくなってしまうなら……", "zh": "我都明白，可是与其让茱莉亚为了配合我，\n而压抑她自己的长处……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0062_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_05_1010_015siz", "source_sha256": "6c9110fa6a26ef11e9492de6044b3f19bb7ee14aac3a091e944e78953992923e", "ja": "私のせいで、ジュリアさんの歌の魅力が\n損なわれるくらいなら……。", "zh": "与其因为我的缘故，\n折损茱莉亚歌声的魅力……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0062_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_05_1011_015siz", "source_sha256": "a55c712a3be2f31777e6713f8934cfdaeb72e0666948201c07a9ed2dc9005664", "ja": "……私を、このユニットから外してください。", "zh": "……不如让我退出这个团体吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0062_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_05_1012_p", "source_sha256": "e1288d468ae76168ea8f4bedc7b00446455a642ff6c8486165b5871dfdb2e606", "ja": "静香……。\nいや、それは……。", "zh": "静香……\n不行，这样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0062_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_05_1013_014mir", "source_sha256": "7dba2acb639b1787b0e59694d3a6098c1591b65979fd3765403408c5d9035955", "ja": "ええ～っ！？", "zh": "什么～！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0062_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_05_1014_016tsu", "source_sha256": "62990befb2ec761be1f914943b3f0ff053ccbd64ab8a012aaacd9ab5b26a2629", "ja": "静香ちゃん、\nジュリアーノとのユニットやめちゃうの？", "zh": "小静，\n你不要和茱莉亚诺组团了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0062_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_05_1015_015siz", "source_sha256": "244c39ef2b39a954108a4615bf70689c4552fa81f352a6275b81b4f83425dba0", "ja": "み、未来！？　翼！？\nき……、聞いてたの……！？", "zh": "未、未来！？翼！？\n你……你们都听见了吗……！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0062_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_05_1016_016tsu", "source_sha256": "51bbbe8621f836061380afc79e24c98064e91631d4cc3ca9de4f7a0a6f96f89a", "ja": "えへへっ。来たらちょうど\nふたりが話してるところだったから、つい……。", "zh": "嘿嘿嘿，我们过来正好发现你们在讲话，\n不小心就……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0062_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_05_1017_015siz", "source_sha256": "ac65f79c9847e17054b8469a82e418e8b7c1b96fdd6b4327e6d71ccef1ae5439", "ja": "つい！？", "zh": "不小心！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0062_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_05_1018_014mir", "source_sha256": "2457819299ca5be2519d23f696e15064e3852521763c5591d5e02298b74c175c", "ja": "それより静香ちゃん、本当にやめちゃうの？\n静香ちゃんのロック、すっごく楽しみだったのに！", "zh": "这不重要，小静，你真的要退出吗？\n可是我很期待听到小静唱摇滚歌曲耶！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0062_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_05_1019_015siz", "source_sha256": "e12d7a4796dbba637e672c0d8c66fdf757d9c080348c44962242c80cbead80a6", "ja": "……しょうがないじゃない。\nジュリアさんの邪魔をするわけにはいかないし……。", "zh": "……这也是没办法的啊。\n我不能妨碍到茱莉亚……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0062_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_05_1020_016tsu", "source_sha256": "447d91d2418679854cfc922e4f7480105128c34ec68f2666d276ccceeb39e18e", "ja": "え～っ？　なにそれ？\nヘンなの～。", "zh": "什么～？这是什么意思？\n好奇怪喔～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0062_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_05_1021_016tsu", "source_sha256": "554d3defdc039c0a1371af079f74010b9c011da0a23a6df05cd34e136fde5d78", "ja": "あ、そうだ！\nねえねえ、{$P$}さ～ん！", "zh": "啊，对了！\n欸欸，{$P$}先生～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0062_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_05_1022_p", "source_sha256": "aaa8e55fb766e412776e805005a78205af300379f1d09337b98facdf677b5019", "ja": "あ、ああ、どうした翼？", "zh": "喔、喔喔，怎么了吗？翼？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0062_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_05_1023_016tsu", "source_sha256": "1e3182afef7201061c6046710808806411aae80b1bea9ddfb087eee38f1d2ef0", "ja": "わたしが静香ちゃんの代わりに立候補しま～す！\nジュリアーノの相手役、いいですよね～？", "zh": "我要报名代替小静～！\n可以让我当茱莉亚诺的搭档吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0062_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_05_1024_015siz", "source_sha256": "8f96a06c3f92c82c71b1a3a651c037df20cfeb6354f8dc50077e39ae14d5a4df", "ja": "っ、ダメよ！！", "zh": "不、不可以！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0062_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_05_1025_016tsu", "source_sha256": "53b8afb0a6b65209d28a3d48f172a2b9e8c81f1f630372cb0dd000070c95f681", "ja": "わっ、びっくりした。\n静香ちゃん、急におっきな声出さないで～。", "zh": "哇！吓我一跳。\n小静，你别突然大喊啦～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0062_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_05_1026_015siz", "source_sha256": "5534e038203db43d50227ad339ff7b8bb0cbb2b86f459ef5745a3609c0575e46", "ja": "あっ……。\nご、ごめん……なさい……。", "zh": "啊……\n对、对……对不起……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0062_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_05_1027_p", "source_sha256": "1c2016cb82402e61d480088fc53a7e3b9591e4455c41828b55dee4f13dcae9aa", "ja": "静香……。\n今のが本当の気持ちなんだろう？", "zh": "静香……\n刚才那是你的真心话吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0062_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_05_1028_015siz", "source_sha256": "8b3390bb83826dd9afd02a0aec60194c747693adedfd99361750b0ba3a63c1b0", "ja": "……私は、その……。", "zh": "……我，那个……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0062_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_05_1029_016tsu", "source_sha256": "bad1cba0a811400e0b3b6a8e81ad984a58b2175e2349112177545cf75544f04a", "ja": "なんだ、そうなの？\nも～、ダメなら最初から言わないでよ～。", "zh": "什么嘛，是这样吗？\n真是的～那你一开始就别说要退出嘛～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0062_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_05_1030_015siz", "source_sha256": "e1a5e577ec9e5e073c24fbd94a45e4b12dd077518bcef051b3f2e243246edbc0", "ja": "……ごめん。\n外して、なんて言っておきながら……。", "zh": "……对不起。\n我自己说要退出，却还说这种话……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0062_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_05_1031_014mir", "source_sha256": "b4e683c7990c2bf300c46a1c954bcd1dca9e1cfbfcfbc47884593eb191e9ea20", "ja": "もう絶対言わないでね、静香ちゃん！\n心配しなくても、静香ちゃんなら大丈夫だよ。", "zh": "绝对不要再说要退出啰，小静！\n不用担心，你一定没问题的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0062_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_05_1032_014mir", "source_sha256": "b90b1d890f13f5fcb8da31872db0ca04489dd2baa55cc0d1639fcbfa8471ef39", "ja": "だって……カッコイイ静香ちゃんは、\n絶対カッコイイから！", "zh": "因为……帅气的小静，\n一定会很帅气啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0062_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_05_1033_014mir", "source_sha256": "5186f5a9947d4eab1c4ccd03aa60ee029df319abb64fc9d8632cc1d051b9686f", "ja": "静香ちゃんはジュリアさんに負けてない！\nおんなじくらいカッコイイもん！", "zh": "小静不会输给茱莉亚的！\n因为你和她一样帅气啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0062_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_05_1034_015siz", "source_sha256": "4000367f4ff7b37bc11d9d13aaa8675a1425b5f482fa255811623e9c77ca5ed1", "ja": "もう、なにそれ、未来ってば……。\nありがとう、でも……。", "zh": "真是的，什么跟什么啊？未来……\n谢谢你，不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0062_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_05_1035_p", "source_sha256": "6ec68996c648f1d583cf0c4a287e265654e91bcb6832edde6732a0f4bcfcb38c", "ja": "……なあ、静香。\nひとつだけ、間違えないで欲しいんだけど。", "zh": "……静香，你听我说。\n有一点我希望你别误会。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0062_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_05_1036_p", "source_sha256": "1df957c38975dca4e0afd1af07e990da705a0f1494037afe3b477cd9f1ebd14b", "ja": "俺はジュリアの相手役に、静香を選んだんじゃない。\n……ジュリアと静香、ふたりを選んだんだ。", "zh": "我不是挑选静香来当茱莉亚的搭档。\n……我是同时挑选了茱莉亚和静香你们两人。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0062_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_05_1037_015siz", "source_sha256": "ac58314340b79f1bd0f09ec18842531cbf3e19dd35881b73d3a49d88741c34b0", "ja": "それは……どう違うんですか？", "zh": "这……请问有什么差别吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0062_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_05_1038_016tsu", "source_sha256": "13fe04916488a3866bf3ed6357e4dacbdcec06103b7f700ff962560ebb58f4fe", "ja": "ジュリアーノがメインなわけじゃなくて、\nどっちも主役～ってことなんじゃないの？", "zh": "意思就是说并不是以茱莉亚诺为主，\n你们两个都是主角～对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0062_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_05_1039_p", "source_sha256": "ec66c6bb590890ea6832fca80d1fbcfbcbfa24779ef0c5c326d3719b6792d358", "ja": "そう。ジュリアと静香なら、ふたりとも、一人で\nいるよりも輝ける。そう思って静香を選んだんだ。", "zh": "没错，茱莉亚与静香，你们这对组合的光芒肯定\n比单独一人时还要耀眼，这才是我选择静香的理由。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0062_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_05_1040_p", "source_sha256": "3c785d7bde80959309ae947933787806487f1446708860e98146b94ebd437936", "ja": "ステージで寄り添うふたりじゃなくて……\n堂々と並び立つ、そんなふたりとして。", "zh": "我不希望你们在舞台上互相依靠……\n而是抬头挺胸、并驾齐驱。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0062_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_05_1041_p", "source_sha256": "352c701715f6de23245fdad50ad80c88fa4e436973c432f747caa7a2b5ffee7c", "ja": "だから、遠慮も気遣いもいらない。合わせようなんて\n思わなくていい。……そんなの、らしくないだろ？", "zh": "所以，你不用顾虑，也不需客气。\n不用配合对方也没关系……你也不是这样的人吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0062_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_05_1042_015siz", "source_sha256": "baf838e1ed91ed38f60e80a4af8f1795c7b783c12e3e6e655b92b5aa64a7c4ca", "ja": "ら、らしくないって……なんですか。\n普段は横柄みたいに言わないでください。", "zh": "你、你这是……什么意思？\n请别说得好像我平常都很傲慢无礼一样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0062_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_05_1043_015siz", "source_sha256": "d052ef3ffaf0925c11f7320887c4a3d02dbead517bdd63c843b728eabd3e967b", "ja": "でも……、そっか。寄り添うんじゃなくて、\n同じステージで並び立つふたり……。", "zh": "不过……我懂了，不是互相依靠，\n而是在舞台上并驾齐驱的两人……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0062_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_05_1044_015siz", "source_sha256": "7f86d79f0e05792ad8bc10f61c52bf091dc7337075f499930bfd531f96fd40ac", "ja": "……あの、{$P$}。", "zh": "……不好意思，{$P$}。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0062_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_05_1045_p", "source_sha256": "49bfa5a5b5d039045ae50047eeae09658f89e2e6c23023bfcc8e7abce06e3efe", "ja": "ん、なんだ？", "zh": "嗯？怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0062_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_05_1046_015siz", "source_sha256": "980d1a36ee3cef29aab00045833559e75004e714ce0857f9757e0ff626982cfe", "ja": "私、やっぱりこのユニット……うまくできる自信は、\nまだ、あまりないですけど……。", "zh": "虽然我还是……没有什么自信，\n能够撑起这个团体……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0062_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_05_1047_015siz", "source_sha256": "564411ec786b8ee06234ffeec11ecd1c14b8b9308fb8a5ad31c0d156709d6986", "ja": "でも、食らいついてみせます。私の歌で、\nジュリアさんと同じ場所に立って……みせます！", "zh": "不过，我会紧紧跟上的。\n我会用我的歌声……和茱莉亚并驾齐驱！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0062_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_05_1048_015siz", "source_sha256": "90f77aa9db74352f555510dab7aaa5119a2a595372a15e8103a4435136f0b3e5", "ja": "だから、続けてみたい……。\nユニット、続けさせてください！", "zh": "所以，我想要继续……\n请让我继续待在这个团体！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0062_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_05_1049_p", "source_sha256": "e8ee1da437bb0bbdfc3fd7a5743fe45dbaf199c43f2945e55980fd800d967c96", "ja": "そうか……！　よかった。\nその言葉を聞けて、安心したよ。", "zh": "这样啊……太好了！\n听到你这么说，我就放心了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0062_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_05_1050_015siz", "source_sha256": "318ad386a729607930bc3e58d1ce1839a07c1096518f8e24c2962f4c81431b4d", "ja": "べ、別に{$P$}のためじゃ\nありませんから。ただ、まあ……。", "zh": "我、我可不是为了{$P$}\n才下定决心的喔，只是因为……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0062_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_05_1051_015siz", "source_sha256": "33983e1f5e1c1f21c9a31ebede3a79c4385722df8159ee3ab9d29fdd9d34236e", "ja": "{$P$}がメンバーを選んだユニットは\n今までうまくいってますし……。", "zh": "目前{$P$}挑选成员组成的团体，\n都发展得很顺利……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0062_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_05_1052_015siz", "source_sha256": "c41392dbf52ce4daa6593eff23667c8a13138f1e606f271cc1f2a36961c4a1bc", "ja": "一応、プロとして人を見る目はあるんだと思ってます。\nだから今回も……それを信じます。", "zh": "我只是认为你身为专业人士，还是有点眼光的。\n所以这次我也……选择相信你的眼光。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0062_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_05_1053_014mir", "source_sha256": "cf95974c3e6f2fa22a7acee86aac6a301d593163cbdfaf422d1929a25e0d63fd", "ja": "よかった～！　応援してるからね、静香ちゃん！", "zh": "太好了～！小静，我们会帮你加油喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0062_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_05_1054_015siz", "source_sha256": "b3f7436a4e4c0065e477572f1f463e456b870499139e7c92b4dd805dd9548751", "ja": "ありがとう。カッコいい私、目指してみる。\nジュリアさんを……越えるつもりで！", "zh": "谢谢，我会努力拿出帅气的一面。\n而且还要……超越茱莉亚！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0062_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_05_1055_016tsu", "source_sha256": "465b565c1afb2bbe378e91ffc4ea9193b0499e127c20ed016d7db8c68fea0ed2", "ja": "楽しみ～♪", "zh": "好期待喔～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0062_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0062_story_05_1056_p", "source_sha256": "9dff03b4350f17ada9722db4b37822ea7f212b6eceee36db44e3fc461eeb3fc0", "ja": "（早速、スタジオのジュリア達にも伝えないとな。\nふたりの準備は整った。さあ、勝負は明日だ！）", "zh": "（我得快点去摄影棚跟茱莉亚她们报告。\n她们俩已经准备好了，接下来明天就是关键！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
